{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_428","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content docs\\\\dev\\\\harness-gap-closure\\\\e02-paired-ablation.md | Select-Object -First 30\nWrite-Output \\\"...\\\"\nWrite-Output \\\"=== acceptance decision ===\\\"\nGet-Content docs\\\\dev\\\\harness-gap-closure\\\\e02-acceptance.json | Select-Object -First 22\"","aggregated_output":"# E02 首个真实组件的配对消融（Phase-4 类型感知淘汰 vs FIFO）\r\n\r\n日期：2026-11-01（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：E02（TF-0275）。GPU/网络/付费调用/真实 provider：无。性质：**内部评测报告**，不是发布或功能完成声明。\r\n\r\n## 1. 组件与 leave-one-out\r\n\r\n| 项 | 内容 |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| 组件 | Phase-4 type-aware eviction（`RuntimeMemoryStore` 的 `evictionPolicy: \"importance\"` + `EVICTION_WEIGHTS_BY_TYPE` 按类型加权打分） |\r\n| treatment | `evictionPolicy: \"importance\"` |\r\n| baseline（leave-one-out） | `evictionPolicy: \"fifo\"` —— Phase-4 之前按插入顺序淘汰的原行为，也是该参数的**默认值** |\r\n| 生产消费者 | `openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/memory-store.ts`（真实 store，非替身） |\r\n| 可逆 | 是。回滚 = 不传 `evictionPolicy` 或不传 `importance`，代码与默认值都不动 |\r\n| opt-in | 是。默认仍是 `fifo`，本包未改默认 |\r\n| 安全相关 | 否。不涉及 approval / 权限 / SSRF / 内容守卫 |\r\n\r\n因为 treatment 与 baseline 是同一个公开参数的两个取值，移除痕迹就是换回默认值——不需要删代码、不需要 patch，也不会污染产品锁。\r\n\r\n## 2. 组件生效验证（先做，再谈效应）\r\n\r\n24/24 个 case 的保留集合在两种策略下**不同**（`divergence.caseCount = 24`）。这是\"组件确实在起作用\"的最低证据；如果全部相同，报告会判 `inconclusive-component-not-observed` 而不是零效应。\r\n\r\n## 3. 语料与配对设计\r\n\r\n- 确定性本地 fixture：`shared/agent-dev/paired-ablation-fixture.json`，无真实 provider 调用。\r\n- 规模：**24 case × 3 重复 × 2 条件 = 144 次回放**（≥20 case 的预登记下限）。\r\n- 配对：每个 case 在 fixture 里**存好**自己的插入顺序（`insertionOrder`），两种条件用**同一个**顺序；seed `openclaw.e02.paired-ablation.v1` 只用于生成并固定该顺序，不参与结果抽样。\r\n- 隔离：每个 case × 每个重复 × 每个条件都**新建 store**（单测 `isolates stores` 断言 12 个新 store 全部从 `facts === 0` 开始），无跨条件状态复用。\r\n- 压力保证：每 case 的 fact 数 > `capacity`，因此必然触发淘汰；否则消融会静默测不到东西（fixture 测试断言了这一点）。\r\n- 语料构成：semantic / episodic / procedural 三型轮转，confidence 0.40–0.95，age 0.5–120 天，每第五个 fact 带 usage bump；每 case 另有一个 human_approved 的 semantic 约束 fact 作为安全必测项。\r\n...\r\n=== acceptance decision ===\r\n{\r\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\r\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-11-01\",\r\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\r\n  \"actor\": \"codex-e02-mainline-developer\",\r\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\r\n  \"scope\": {\r\n    \"task\": \"TF-0275\",\r\n    \"packet\": \"E02\",\r\n    \"title\": \"First real effective single-component paired ablation\",\r\n    \"component\": \"phase4-type-aware-eviction\",\r\n    \"productionConsumer\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/memory-store.ts\",\r\n    \"source\": \"deterministic pre-registered local fixture (no live provider)\",\r\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\r\n    \"realHuman\": false,\r\n    \"network\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"decision\": {\r\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\r\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\r\n    \"reason\": \"Component is real, reversible, non-safety, opt-in and measured on the real RuntimeMemoryStore. Retention sets diverge on 24/24 cases, so the component is verifiably in effect. The paired report carries success, pass^k, p50/p95, token proxy, false blocks, safety violations, effect size and a 95% interval. The observed effect is positive but the interval spans zero, so no benefit is claimed. All five pre-registered budget checks pass. No product default, lock or approval change.\",\r\n    \"effect\": {\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_429","type":"agent_message","text":"Implementation is complete and verified. Here's the summary.\n\n**What I built**\n\nA paired ablation of Phase-4 type-aware eviction against the pre-Phase-4 FIFO default, replayed on the real `RuntimeMemoryStore` — no mocks, no stand-in store.\n\n- `scripts/lib/paired-ablation.mjs` — pure statistics (percentile, Wilson, paired t-interval, exact sign test, pass^k) plus an injected-store driver that builds a fresh isolated store per case × repeat × condition.\n- `scripts/run-paired-ablation.mjs` — runner (`pnpm agent-dev:paired-ablation`); refuses to substitute a fake store if the runtime can't load.\n- `shared/agent-dev/paired-ablation-fixture.json` — 24 cases × 3 repeats × 2 conditions, pre-registered budget, stored insertion order per case.\n- Two test files, a task spec, a boundary rule, and the closure docs + `E02-SHA256SUMS`.\n\n**Result (honest, not flattering)**\n\nRetention sets diverge on 24/24 cases, so the component is genuinely in effect. Point estimate is **+5.29pp** (0.6829 → 0.7358), but the 95% interval is **[-0.0367, +0.1425] — it spans zero**, so `benefit.established = false`. Verdict is `within-budget` with 0 of 5 budget checks violated. The one strong signal is safety-side: FIFO dropped the human-approved constraint fact 30 times, Phase-4 zero times. Per-case deltas include negatives, and the docs say plainly that 24 cases cannot resolve a 5pp effect.\n\nI deliberately rejected an absolute retention floor as the gate — it would have measured fixture pressure, not the component. The budget is a paired comparison plus a rule that a benefit claim requires the interval above zero.\n\n**Checks actually run**\n\n- Focused tests: 35/35 pass (23 pure-stats, 12 real-store). Also re-ran `runtime-memory-type-aware-eviction` (9/9).\n- Scoped ESLint on the three source/test files: exit 0, no findings.\n- Typecheck: `tsc -p tsconfig.test.json` reports zero diagnostics for my files, but the full project run fails on pre-existing `TS2307` errors for uninstalled runtime deps. Recorded as a **partial** gate, not a pass.\n- Harness validate + dry-run: both pass with a real non-empty diff, run in a throwaway git copy because this workspace has no `.git`.\n- Credential scan 0 hits; SHA256SUMS verifies 10/10 with the repo's own canonical hasher.\n- Two pre-existing failures I did not fix: `harness-gap-reliability-aggregation.md` and `harness-gap-trace-cost-sampling.md` are missing `lifecycleStatus` (breaks `check-spec-lifecycle` and one harness unit test). Also `runtime-memory-store.test.ts` and `runtime-memory-phase4-ablation-benefit.test.ts` can't run here — missing `kysely` and other modules.\n\n**Environment notes**\n\nNo dependencies were installed and no network was used. To run vitest I temporarily junctioned `D:\\ClawX\\node_modules` into the workspace, then removed it; the source tree is untouched. Scratch files are gone and `node_modules` is absent again. `artifacts/paired-ablation/report.json` is the raw local run output and stays untracked per the repo's artifact-retention policy — the curated copies in `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/` are the tracked record.\n\nOne thing worth flagging: I added `scripts/repository-artifacts.json` and `.gitignore` entries so the three evidence files are trackable. That is the repo's own `--write-ignore` output, scoped to my files only, but it does touch shared policy files — worth a glance in review."}}
